## Harness workflow

Use `/dev` for coding, planning, refactoring and debugging.

Use `/review-pr` for reviewing somebody else's pull request.

For bugs, establish root cause before speculative fixes.

Do not claim completion without fresh executable evidence.

Version-controlled code, tests, schemas, rules and ADRs are authoritative. Memory and task ledgers are caches/state, not architectural truth.
